<title>SWEDEN: Marieberg, TV4 trade suspended - bourse.</title>
<headline>Marieberg, TV4 trade suspended - bourse.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stockholm Stock Exchange said on Tuesday that trading in shares of Swedish media group Marieberg AB and television station TV4 was suspended.</p>
</text>
